# Google AdSense publisher ID (ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX).
# Required to earn from the match-end interstitial and the take-back rewarded ad.
# Without it the game uses Google test ads, then a house missive, so the flow
# still works on localhost. Apply at https://www.google.com/adsense/ and add
# this site once it is live.
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT=

# Force AdSense test creatives even with a real publisher ID.
# VITE_ADS_TEST=1

# Play the house missive when Google has no fill. Default: on in development
# and whenever VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT is empty; off in a paid production build.
# VITE_ADS_HOUSE=1

# Stripe Payment Link for the Merlin Pass (no ads), priced at USD 5.
# Create a one-time product in Stripe, turn on Adaptive Pricing so checkout
# shows the buyer's currency, and set the success URL to:
#   https://YOUR_DOMAIN/?merlin=success&session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}
# VITE_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK=https://buy.stripe.com/xxxxxxxx
